Fix blank page when clicking a pill button for the active tab

TabGroup:SetActiveTab early-returns when the target tab is already active,
so it never re-snaps that tab's FadeLayer. If the Settings page (or a prior
crossfade) left the layer hidden, restoring the window showed a blank page.
The pill click handler now force-shows the clicked tab's FadeLayer after
SetActiveTab, so an explicit pill click always reveals that page.
